  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Budovanie funk&#x10D;n&#xE9;ho a udr&#x17E;ate&#x13E;n&#xE9;ho syst&#xE9;mu odpadov&#xE9;ho hospod&#xE1;rstva v obci Criuleni</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building functional and sustainable waste management system in the municipality of Criuleni</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to improve the quality of life and health of the population, the project helps the municipality of Criuleni and two neighbouring villages (Ohrincea and Zolonceni) to develop a new strategy and system for waste management, promoting recycling culture with a special focus on composting and raising awareness about sustainable development.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">V z&#xE1;ujme zlep&#x161;enia kvality &#x17E;ivota a zdravia obyvate&#x13E;stva pom&#xE1;ha projekt obci Criuleni a dvom pri&#x13E;ahl&#xFD;m obciam (Ohrincea a Zolonceni) pri rozv&#xED;jan&#xED; novej strat&#xE9;gie a systemu odpadov&#xE9;ho hospod&#xE1;rstva, kult&#xFA;ry recykl&#xE1;cie s osobitn&#xFD;m zameran&#xED;m na kompostovanie a zvysovani povedomia o trvalo udr&#x17E;ate&#x13E;nom rozvoji.</narrative>
  </description>
